Tempo programmable protocol emulator

The Tiny Tapeout project scaffolding in .github/workflows/, src/config.json,
and the initial .gitignore and info.yaml structure comes from:
https://github.com/TinyTapeout/ttihp-verilog-template
branch cmos5l, commit b86a2a781484bcab7ba522dc5de540086695a430.

That template is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, reproduced
in LICENSE. Project-specific additions and modifications were made in 2026.

External tools, the IHP process design kit, and standard-cell models retain
their upstream licenses and are fetched separately rather than redistributed
as project source. Their exact selected versions appear in flow-lock.json.

Generated physical layouts contain IHP standard-cell geometry from the pinned
IHP Open PDK, copyright IHP PDK Authors, licensed under Apache 2.0. The unmodified
PDK source and its notices are available at the repository revision in flow-lock.json.
